ns [DHIS2-19750]\n\nPR #21479 added a program-stage prefix to metaData.items keys for aggregate\n(non-query) event/enrollment analytics responses whenever a QueryItem has a\nprogram stage, dropping the bare item id entirely. This broke backwards\ncompatibility for any existing integration doing a metaData.items lookup by\nthe plain data element/attribute uid, even for ordinary single-stage queries\nwith no cross-stage ambiguity.\n\nThe sibling /query (row-level) endpoint already avoided this by writing both\nthe stage-prefixed and bare keys to the same MetadataItem\n(MetadataItemsHandler.addItemToMetadata). Apply the same dual-write to the\naggregate endpoint's addItemsAndFiltersMetadataForNonQuery so both forms\nresolve, matching the query endpoint's existing behavior. metaData.dimensions\nand the headers array are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"1a6621caa9da1de581cc3aec5f4a7e55d02d845a","tree_id":"8db0f1043e443c9723a8d138fdfc0584da2520cc","timestamp":"2026-07-24T09:48:43Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.c